<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Single dual-format ModInfo that loads on every supported game version.

     Two mod-loader generations disagree on the layout, and this file satisfies both:
       * A21 / 1.0 / 2.x / 3.x expect the FLAT "V2" format: fields directly under <xml>,
         with a mandatory <DisplayName>. Their loader routes on XLinq
         root.Element("ModInfo") which is NAMESPACE-SENSITIVE, so the <ModInfo> block
         below (in the urn:cmm-legacy namespace) is invisible to it -> it uses the flat
         fields. A stray namespaced element is ignored by the V2 field reader.
       * Alpha 20 expects the LEGACY "V1" format: a nested <ModInfo> element. Its loader
         matches on XmlNode.Name (the qualified name), which ignores the namespace URI, so
         it DOES see <ModInfo> and parses it. The flat fields log harmless
         "Unknown element" warnings there.

     The namespace MUST be a DEFAULT namespace (xmlns=, no prefix) so the element's
     qualified name stays exactly "ModInfo" for A20; a prefixed name would not match.

     Version is duplicated in both blocks — keep them in sync by hand when bumping.

     KEEP IT PARSEABLE BY System.Version. The 3.x loader (Mod.cs) runs Version.TryParse on this
     string and warns "does not define a valid Version" in every user's log when it fails, which
     it does for anything non-numeric: 1.0.2a, 1.0.2b, 1.0.3a and 1.0.5RC1/2/3 all tripped it.
     The game keeps the raw text separately as VersionString, so the mod list still displayed
     them correctly — which is why it went unnoticed for months. Point releases therefore go in
     a FOURTH numeric component (1.0.5 -> 1.0.5.1), not a letter suffix.

     1.0.5.1 IS the build published as "1.0.5a". 1.0.5 shipped as RC4 on 2026-08-30 and is the
     release; everything after it is a revision, and the letter is what the mod pages call it
     while this field stays a number the game can parse. -->
<xml>
  <Name value="ContextMusicManager"/>
  <DisplayName value="Context Music Manager"/>
  <Author value="Velasha"/>
  <Description value="Plays custom music based on context."/>
  <Website value="https://www.nexusmods.com/7daystodie/mods/10649"/>
  <Version value="1.0.5.1"/>
  <!-- Alpha 20 only reads this nested block (see header). Keep Version matched above. -->
  <ModInfo xmlns="urn:cmm-legacy">
    <Name value="ContextMusicManager"/>
    <Description value="Plays custom music based on context."/>
    <Author value="Velasha"/>
    <Version value="1.0.5.1"/>
    <Website value="https://www.nexusmods.com/7daystodie/mods/10649"/>
  </ModInfo>
</xml>
